===Skeletal Dragon===
The '''[[Skyrim:Skeletal Dragon|Skeletal Dragon]]''' is a unique dragon found only in [[Skyrim:Labyrinthian|Labyrinthian]] that is made up entirely of bone, with no scales or flesh, and cannot fly. It breathes frost, but has no resistance to frost or weakness to fire; instead, it has weakness to magic (100 pts). The Skeletal Dragon has no soul to absorb and, unlike living dragons, drops only dragon bones when killed. The Skeletal Dragon's base damage is 50, and its bite attack multiplies this damage by 2 instead of 1.5.
