==={{Anchor|Serpentine Dragon}}{{DB}}===
'''Serpentine Dragons''' are found only on [[Skyrim:Solstheim|Solstheim]] and can breathe frost or fire. Their appearance is unique compared to other dragons, most notably their blue hue, lack of scutes, and oversized bottom jaws which give them a distinctive underbite. They are formidable foes, possessing slightly greater strength than an Ancient Dragon. There is one named Serpentine Dragon, [[Skyrim:Sahrotaar|Sahrotaar]], whom [[Skyrim:Miraak (person)|Miraak]] uses as his mount. Serpentine Dragons begin to appear in leveled lists at level 55 if ''Dragonborn'' is installed.
