==Loot==
[[File:SR-creature-Dragon Dead.jpg|thumb|right|A mighty dragon lies dead]]
The standard loot for dragons is listed below; revered and legendary dragons give additional loot.
* 100–318 gold, depending on level and chance
* 1 or 3 dragon scales (average 2.5)
* 1 or 3 dragon bones (average 2.5)
** 1 @ 100% chance, 2 more @ 75% chance
* 25% chance of a piece of armor
** 33% unenchanted [[Skyrim:Light Armor (item)|light armor]]
** 33% unenchanted [[Skyrim:Heavy Armor (item)|heavy armor]]
** 22% enchanted light armor
** 11% enchanted heavy armor
* 25% chance of a weapon
** 50% unenchanted [[Skyrim:One-Handed Weapons|one-handed]] weapon
** 25% unenchanted [[Skyrim:Two-Handed Weapons|two-handed]] weapon
** 25% [[Skyrim:Generic Magic Weapons|enchanted weapon]] (any type)
* 25% chance of a [[Skyrim:Gems|gem]]

