==Dragon Riding{{DB}}==
With the ''[[Skyrim:Dragonborn|Dragonborn]]'' [[Skyrim:Add-ons|add-on]], you have the ability to [[Skyrim:Dragon Riding|ride specific dragons]] after obtaining all three words of the [[Skyrim:Bend Will|Bend Will]] dragon shout. After shouting at the desired dragon, it will land and you will be able to get on its back, and it will engage in flight. You give the dragon instructions, rather than directly controlling the dragon. There are a few dragons that you are unable to ride.

